<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>遊戲宇宙 - GAME WORLD</title>
  
  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Orbitron:wght@400;600;700&family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  
  <style>
    /* ===== 全局設定 ===== */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0a0a12;
      --bg-card: #12121f;
      --neon-green: #39ff14;
      --neon-blue: #00f3ff;
      --neon-pink: #ff00ff;
      --text-primary: #ffffff;
      --text-secondary: #b0b0c0;
      --font-title: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
      --font-body: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
    }

    /* ===== Header ===== */
    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
      padding: 1rem 5%;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .header-container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--neon-blue);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.5);
    }

    nav ul {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    nav a {
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: var(--neon-green);
    }

    nav a::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -5px;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--neon-green);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    nav a:hover::after {
      width: 100%;
    }

    /* 手機版選單隱藏 */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      nav ul {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    /* ===== Hero Section ===== */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 10, 18, 0.8), rgba(10, 10, 18, 0.9)),
                  url('https://picsum.photos/1920/1080?random=1') center/cover no-repeat;
      min-height: 80vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 800px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-pink));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.3);
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-pink));
      color: var(--bg-dark);
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      border-radius: 50px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4);
    }

    .cta-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 255, 0.6);
    }

    /* ===== 遊戲推薦區塊 ===== */
    .games-section {
      padding: 5rem 5%;
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      color: var(--neon-green);
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4);
    }

    .games-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .game-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border-radius: 15px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
      border: 1px solid rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);
    }

    .game-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.3);
    }

    .game-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 200px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .game-info {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .game-info h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--neon-blue);
    }

    .game-info p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .game-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--neon-green);
      color: var(--neon-green);
      font-weight: 500;
      border-radius: 25px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .game-button:hover {
      background: var(--neon-green);
      color: var(--bg-dark);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.5);
    }

    /* ===== 新聞區塊 ===== */
    .news-section {
      padding: 5rem 5%;
      background: var(--bg-card);
    }

    .news-container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .news-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .news-item {
      background: var(--bg-dark);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-pink);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }

    .news-item:hover {
      transform: translateX(5px);
    }

    .news-item h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--neon-pink);
    }

    .news-date {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .news-item p {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
    }

    /* ===== Footer ===== */
    footer {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #0a0a12 100%);
      padding: 3rem 5%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .footer-content {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .social-links {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
    }

    .social-links a {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }

    .social-links a:hover {
      color: var(--neon-blue);
    }

    .copyright {
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    /* ===== 手機版回應式設計 ===== */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }

      .hero p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .games-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .header-container {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .cta-button {
        padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .game-info h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Header -->
  <header>
    <div class="header-container">
      <div class="logo">🎮 遊戲宇宙</div>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#home">首頁</a></li>
          <li><a href="#games">遊戲推薦</a></li>
          <li><a href="#news">新聞</a></li>
          <li><a href="#about">關於我們</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">聯絡我們</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>探索最強遊戲世界</h1>
      <p>發現最新最熱門的遊戲，體驗極致電競樂趣，加入百萬玩家的世界！</p>
      <a href="#games" class="cta-button">立即開始</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 遊戲推薦區塊 -->
  <section class="games-section" id="games">
    <h2 class="section-title">熱門遊戲推薦</h2>
    <div class="games-grid">
      <!-- 遊戲卡片 1 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=2" alt="遊戲 1" />
        <div class="game-info">
          <h3>魔幻戰爭</h3>
          <p>體驗史詩級的魔幻戰鬥，選擇你的英雄，帶領軍隊征服敵對國度。開放世界多人線上角色扮演遊戲。</p>
          <a href="#" class="game-button">了解更多</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 遊戲卡片 2 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=3" alt="遊戲 2" />
        <div class="game-info">
          <h3>速度極限</h3>
          <p>超真實賽車模擬體驗，在世界各地馳騁。升級你的愛車，與其他玩家競速爭奪冠軍寶座。</p>
          <a href="#" class="game-button">了解更多</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 遊戲卡片 3 -->
      <div class="game-card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/400/300?random=4" alt="遊戲 3" />
        <div class="game-info">
          <h3>太空冒險</h3>
          <p>探索無垠宇宙，發現新星球，建立太空站。戰略與探索並重的科幻策略遊戲，帶領你的文明走向榮耀。</p>
          <a href="#" class="game-button">了解更多</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 最新遊戲新聞 -->
  <section class="news-section" id="news">
    <div class="news-container">
      <h2 class="section-title">最新遊戲新聞</h2>
      <div class="news-list">
        <div class="news-item">
          <h3>《魔幻戰爭》更新版本震撼登場</h3>
          <div class="news-date">2026 年 5 月 1 日</div>
          <p>全新地圖、英雄角色和 PVP 模式正式上線，玩家可體驗更刺激的戰鬥樂趣。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="news-item">
          <h3>電競_world 錦標賽報名熱烈進行中</h3>
          <div class="news-date">2026 年 4 月 28 日</div>
          <p>總獎金超過 1000 萬港元，全球頂尖戰隊將在這裏一決高下，報名截止日為 5 月 15 日。</p>
        </div>

        <div class="news-item">
          <h3>《速度極限》手機版正式發佈</h3>
          <div class="news-date">2026 年 4 月 25 日</div>
          <p>隨時隨地體驗極速競賽，手機版獨家優化操作介面，支援多人線上連線對戰。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <div class="footer-content">
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="#" title="Facebook">📘</a>
        <a href="#" title="Instagram">📷</a>
        <a href="#" title="Twitter">🐦</a>
        <a href="#" title="YouTube">📺</a>
        <a href="#" title="Discord">💬</a>
      </div>
      <p class="copyright">© 2026 遊戲宇宙 GAME WORLD. 版權所有。</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
